`deal_map` deals `RUN_ACTS` acts of `RUN_ACT_ROWS` rows built from `RUN_MAP_PATHS` non-crossing seeded walks on a `RUN_MAP_COLUMNS` grid, each act ending at a lone boss. A `RunNode` carries its grid `column` and `next`; `Go` elsewhere is refused. Every route holds 12–16 fights (bosses counted) and ≥ 8 tiles, by construction, proven by DP on both contents. `run-sim` walks reachable nodes and prints route fights; the map screen shows the whole map, reachable nodes live; the docs agree.

