      - text: the tiles bound caps fights at rows − 8; bosses and act 1's first row are fights (a run opens on one); the start chance comes from the bounds' middle; the flip loop and why it ends (a pure row moves every route by one and cannot overshoot once the spread fits; a mixed row only narrows it), on the run's `Rng`, no redeal; kinds are dealt after; no campfire row.
